  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_RESPINS
    value: <style=title><size=42>RE-SPINS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_RESPINS
    value: "<size=24>- Lucky Pet Salon is a 9 reels game in a 3x3 grid.\n- 3 or more
      identical symbols in any position will be locked and trigger \n  a re-spin.\n-
      Subsequent symbols that originally triggered the re-spin will also lock, \n
      \ and re-spins will be given until no additional same symbol appears.\n- Pay
      will be given only once at the end of re-spins.\n- During the re-spin, only
      the symbols that triggered the bonus will count \n  towards the win. All other
      symbols cannot create new wins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES & JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers 10 Free Games.\n- In Free Games,
      there are 10 reels instead of 9.\n- Same re-spin rules apply as in base game.\n-
      If the player receives 6 or more Scatters, \n  the player will be awarded a
      progressive in \n  addition to Free Games. \n- Progressive may be won in either
      the base game \n  or free games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>Scatter Pays</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 9</color></size>'
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Lucky Pet Salon
